The SVG icons in this folder are the "Flat" style of Microsoft's Fluent Emoji,
https://github.com/microsoft/fluentui-emoji, taken from commit 1ffb34c75
(24 August 2026) and renamed to the emoji's name in lower case, so
"Ear of corn" is ear_of_corn.svg.

